BEGIN_KEY PS_CYCLESTATS_CPU_SAMPLEMODE
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x3dfe58
    RemappedName:       D3D_d7f6275667
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "Doesn't do much right now. Defaults to load/store micro-ops"
END_KEY

BEGIN_KEY PS_CYCLESTATS_CPU_INTERVAL
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x872971
    RemappedName:       D3D_e7f6275667
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "The CPU will sample EIP every time the number of events specified by PS_CYCLESTATS_CPU_SAMPLEMODE hits this number."
END_KEY

BEGIN_KEY PS_CYCLESTATS_CPU_THRESHOLD
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0xf4099f
    RemappedName:       D3D_f7f6275667
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "If the MSECONDTHRESHOLD bit is not set in PS_CYCLESTATS_CPU_FLAGS then frame stats are dumped starting at the value of this key * 100. If MSECONDTHRESHOLD is set, then this key is a millisecond threshold value for the frame time. Any frame time which EXCEEDS this value will have its stats dumped."
END_KEY

