            DISABLE_PROP_DEBUG1_PRI_WRITE                                                 = 0x02000000, "Avoid writing to the NV_PGRAPH_PRI_GPCS_PROP_DEBUG1 register . Effectively leaves BLENDOPT and SWALLOW_ROP to default values. GA100 needs this for HW bug http://nvbugs/2702359 "
