BEGIN_KEY REPORT_D3D12_DDI_SUPPORTED
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x03268b
    RemappedName:       D3D_29567354
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "Determine the additional (WDDM2.1+) DDI versions to report (D3D12DDI_SUPPORTED_*).  Encode the enum suffix in the dword (i.e. D3D12DDI_SUPPORTED_0013, write 0x00000013"
    Default: 0x000000FF
END_KEY

BEGIN_KEY D3D12_REDIST_MIN_WDDM_VERSION
    DefinedWhen:        1
    BinaryID:           0x03268c
    RemappedName:       D3D_29567355
    Type:               dword
    Documentation:      "D3D12 redist support requires a base minimum WDDM version.  WDDM versions below that don't support the redist (and cap the DDI reported values based on the WDDM version) and versions greater or equal do support it (and report DDI values greater than what was available when that WDDM version launched)."
    Default: 0x00002600
END_KEY


